      "file": "customers/customers-domain/src/main/java/net/chrisrichardson/examples/monolithiccustomersandorders/customers/domain/CustomerServiceImpl.java",
      "description": "The `customers` domain publishes events via the Observer pattern.\nFor exmple, an event is published when a `Customer` is created.",
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "file": "customers/customers-api-observer-pojo/src/main/java/net/chrisrichardson/examples/monolithiccustomersandorders/customers/api/observer/pojo/CustomerDomainObservers.java",
      "description": "Observers can register by calling `registerObserver()`, which is implemented by the `CustomerDomainObservers` interface.\n\nThis interface is the `customers-api-observer-pojo` Gradle subproject, which is another Domain API module for the `customers` domain.",
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "file": "notifications/notifications-customer-observer-pojo-adapter/src/main/java/net/chrisrichardson/examples/monolithiccustomersandorders/notifications/customerobserver/pojoadapter/CustomerDomainObserverPojoAdapterConfiguration.java",
      "description": "One observer is the `notifications` domain module.\n\nThe `notifications-customer-observer-pojo-adapter` Gradle subproject registers a `CustomerDomainObserverPojoAdapter` for events.\nAs a result, `notifications-domain` doesn't depend on the `customers` domain module.",
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "file": "notifications/notifications-customer-observer-pojo-adapter/src/main/java/net/chrisrichardson/examples/monolithiccustomersandorders/notifications/customerobserver/pojoadapter/CustomerDomainObserverPojoAdapter.java",
      "description": "The adapter's `noteCustomerCreated()` method is invoked when a `Customer` is created.\nIt calls `CustomerEventHandler`, an interface defined by `notifications-domain`.",
      "line": 16
    },
